<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech cenbank one-week rev repo ave yield 38.99pct.</title>
<headline>Czech cenbank one-week rev repo ave yield 38.99pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average yield in a Czech National Bank (CNB) one-week reverse repo draining liquidity reached 38.99 percent, after 44.93 percent in a similar repo held on Wednesday, the CNB said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The central bank said it accepted all bids at the limit rate of 39 percent.</p>
</text>
